abstract: >-
  Code, archived simulation summaries, portable evidence from the raw simulation
  output, complete proofs (Online Resources 1-3) and manuscript sources for the
  article "Fitting One Factor to Two Traits: Population Solutions and Fit
  Indices", which derives the population one-factor solution and its fit
  indices when the items measure two correlated traits.
keywords:
  - factor analysis
  - fit indices
  - unidimensionality
  - reproducibility
